  "styles.barsCap": "Tha gach bàr a' dol on luach as lugha chun an luach as motha am measg longan a' chlas sin. Tagh tomhas.",
  "styles.barsCapLog": "Tha gach bàr a' dol on luach as lugha chun an luach as motha am measg longan a' chlas sin (sgèile log, gus am fan na clasaichean beaga faicsinneach). Tagh tomhas.",
  "styles.colossalLine": "Clas os cionn an LEVIATHAN 1.2 km. Gun dealbhadh fhathast.",
